### G. published-artifact facts this decision rests on
OK   axum's state-carrying impl<S> Router<S> is bounded S: Clone + Send + Sync + 'static
OK   with_state is what turns a Router<S> into a Router<S2> -- no state, no service
OK   axum documents FromRef substates on one State type
OK   the graceful drain awaits close_tx.closed()
OK   occurrences of 'timeout' or 'deadline' in axum src/serve/mod.rs (the drain is unbounded) = 0
OK   axum::serve exists only with the tokio feature plus http1 or http2
OK   axum declares [lints.rust] unsafe_code = "forbid"
OK   occurrences of 'unsafe' in axum src/ = 0
  axum default features: form,http1,json,matched-path,original-uri,query,tokio,tower-log,tracing
OK   tokio default = [] -- every feature is opted into explicitly
OK   tokio feature 'signal' does NOT enable sync
OK   tokio feature 'net' does NOT enable sync
OK   tokio feature 'rt-multi-thread' does NOT enable sync
OK   tokio feature 'time' does NOT enable sync
OK   tokio feature 'macros' does NOT enable sync
OK   tokio 'sync' is its own leaf feature, so it must be listed explicitly
